<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Irish NTMA sets 100 mln punt tap in 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Irish NTMA sets 100 mln punt tap in 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ireland's National Treasury Management Agency (NTMA) on Friday announced a 100 million punt tap issue in the eight percent bond due 2006.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 660 3377</p>
</text>
